    <detaileddescription>
<para>This source file contains the implementation of <computeroutput>reflection::short_name()</computeroutput>, which extracts the base file name from a fully qualified path by returning the portion after the last <computeroutput>/</computeroutput> separator, or the original string if no separator is present.</para>
<para>All definitions reside within the <computeroutput><ref refid="namespacemicro__os__plus_1_1micro__test__plus_1_1reflection" kindref="compound">micro_os_plus::micro_test_plus::reflection</ref></computeroutput> namespace.</para>
<para>This file must be included when building the µTest++ library. </para>
